 "tagline": "Twenty-two guests, eleven cabins, and the coves even UnCruise's other boats cannot reach.",
 "answer": "Safari Quest is UnCruise's smallest yacht: 120 feet, 22 guests in 11 cabins, one crew member for every two guests. She sails Alaska's Glacier Wilderness, a week round trip from Juneau through Glacier Bay's outer reaches, Admiralty Island and Dawes Glacier, from May to September, and the Inside Passage between Seattle and Juneau in spring and autumn. Fares run from $9,900 per person; the whole yacht can be chartered.",
